  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The strength of your jaws is uncanny and once you sink your teeth in you can hold on like a steel vice.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Cherufe (zavr subtype), base attack bonus +9.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may make a free grapple combat maneuver check that does not provoke attacks of opportunity when you hit with your bite attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/racial-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
